{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id156828491"}, "name":{"label":"GiddyUpHorsey"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-12-07T00:21:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.9"}, "id":{"label":"8103873296"}, "title":{"label":"Great habit tracker app!"}, "content":{"label":"The best habit tracker app in my opinion. It’s comes at a very reasonable price and does what it promises to very well.\n\nI got it about 3 weeks ago and have been using it every day since. I love that it works across iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch. It syncs across them and integrates beautifully with Apple Health.\n\nOne improvement though, would be to make more pages available. Four isn’t enough. The graphs/insights could also be better.\n\nHaving tried a couple of trials for other Habit Trackers, I can say that this app is the best value for money. The others are a rip-off!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id357168174"}, "name":{"label":"VasantP86"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-11-29T15:36:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.9"}, "id":{"label":"8077820461"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic app, just a few minor holes"}, "content":{"label":"Love this app, really helps me stay on top of life. Being able to link to an HTML let's me link to a checklist in Things3 or Trello with a habit stack. \n\nCouple of minor flaws\n1. You can't track more than your target (I.e. if the targets 4 days a week you can't track a 5th day &\n2. For weekly habits, there's no daily data, I can only see how I'm talking for the week& if the habit was completed on previous weeks, not what days it was completed on.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id337076401"}, "name":{"label":"Ivanapinyon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-01-03T00:44:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.0.9"}, "id":{"label":"6825214427"}, "title":{"label":"The Only Honest Habit"}, "content":{"label":"This app is outstanding, not only for its clever design, but for the fact that it is the only app of its kind that is not trying to track you and sell your data, sell you an expensive BS subscription you don’t need, or both. In other words, it’s the only habit app not trying to scam you. \n\nThere are still indie developers out their not on the grift, but they’re becoming harder to find.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"8"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"15"}}, 
